                sealed true
                log (
                    {
                        at 2026-08-14T12:15:41.381389Z
                        author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                        kind @decision
                        text "Dep flipped: grammar now depends on parser, not the reverse. The original order was wrong. Callers of the five functions holding grammar.rs's cg3_quit sites are overwhelmingly inside the parser — add_set has 12 parser call sites across driver/rules/mod/parser_helpers vs 8 internal, add_anchor is 4/4 parser, add_template and remove_numeric_tags are parser-only. Converting their signatures to Result first would hand a Result to call sites that still return () and cannot propagate it, forcing either an unwrap (reintroducing the panic being removed) or a temporary shim. Converting the parser first means every one of those call sites is already in a Result-returning function, so this phase becomes a signature change plus `?`. The reindex half (StaticSetAlias / StaticSetRedefined, already inside a Result-returning fn) is independent of the ordering and could land any time."
                    }

                    {
                        at 2026-08-14T16:10:27.100952Z
                        author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                        kind @status
                        text "Todo → Doing (nplan start)"
